<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has placed all three credits whereby it sought to inject 2.961 billion pesos in the secondary market on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The credits were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM     MAX    MIN     AVG   BIDS  BIDDERS</p>
<p>987   million pesos  12 days   34.02  33.97  34.00    5    2</p>
<p>987   million pesos   6 days   34.00  33.65  33.79    5    3</p>
<p>987   million pesos   1 days   33.75  33.60  33.65    5    4</p>
<p>NOTE: The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
